# This directory contains sensitive secrets
# Secrets are mounted as files for enhanced security
# 
# Required files:
# - grafana_admin_password.txt
# - grafana_secret_key.txt
# - grafana_db_password.txt
# - postgres_password.txt
# - elastic_password.txt
# - kibana_encryption_key.txt
# - influxdb_password.txt
# - influxdb_admin_token.txt
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit actual secret files to version control
# Use proper secret management in production (HashiCorp Vault, etc.)